{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About <i>Sur Le Fil</i> (aka SLF)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SLF is an I.L.E. \u2014 Integrated Learning Environment (E.A.I. in French) \u2014 developed by <strong>AngeloStudio</strong>, blending science, history, and humor into a unique educational adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a whimsical 3D campus, you will explore and learn:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Electricity / Electronics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mechanics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Computer Science (hardware &amp; software)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Programming (C, C#, assembly, etc.)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Math, Physics, Chemistry, History of Science</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by Prof Fil and Kelhann (a mischievous little lightbulb), you\u2019ll attend classes, run real experiments (saltwater battery, telegraph, DIY multimeter\u2026), and complete missions that grow in complexity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udd2c Everything is designed to be <strong>fun</strong>, <strong>visual</strong>, and <strong>educational</strong> \u2014 with no ads, no lootboxes \u2014 just pure learning and curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Languages available: <strong>French, English, German, Spanish</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1645050?t=1767940374","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1645050?t=1767940374","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1645050/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767940374","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1645050/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767940374","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],